This distribution contains weights converted and quantized for Draw Things from the Pika H3 Flex FL2VA release. The Pika H3 Flex FL2VA adapter is merged into the MiniMax H3 FL2VA transformer, which is supplied in the i8x, i4x and q8p formats; the Qwen3-VL encoder is supplied in the i8x format and the VAE in FP16.

